description:
GitBak mirrors Bitbucket/GitHub/Gist repositories; paths, users,
and authentication are specified in ~/.gitbak.

When run, gitbak:

* asks for unspecified passwords;
* lists repositories using APIs - authenticating if necessary;
* clones/updates repositories;
* shows a summary (if verbose)

GitBak mirrors Bitbucket/GitHub/Gist repositories; paths, users,
and authentication are specified in ~/.gitbak.

When run, gitbak:

* asks for unspecified passwords;
* lists repositories using APIs - authenticating if necessary;
* clones/updates repositories;
* shows a summary (if verbose)

== Usage

    p Terminal.size # ⇒ {height: 90, width: 161}
    p Terminal.size! # to get 80×25 as a fallback instead of nil

Provides basic assets for Cielo form inputs, such as credit card flag icons;
a helper method that generate inputs and labels for credit card selection;
and sass styles that makes flag icons behave as radio buttons.

